#: folio/dpi-h-ra/ch3-the-reference-architecture-for-d/p-3-5-3-1-f35f6f.md:2
msgid "Terminology Service — manages the codes, value sets, and vocabularies that define what data means, supporting semantic interoperability across systems."
msgstr ""

